$ HA144A — FULL-SPAN, MSC aero-correction form (#104 gate)
$ Ref: MSC Nastran 2021.3 Aeroelastic Analysis User's Guide, Listing 7-1
$
$ Identical to ha144a_fullspan_sbeam.bdf except for the aero corrections: the 0.1 deg
$ wing incidence is MSC's DMIJ W2GJ matrix (box IDs) instead of two native W2GJ cards,
$ and HA144A's identity WKK is given as MSC's DMIK WKK.  It must trim to the native
$ deck's numbers to round-off (tests/aero/test_aero_matrices.py).
$ The archive listing HA144A.bdf enters the same data with DMI (row numbers), which
$ sbeam refuses: DMI rows need the order of the CAERO1 entries in the j-set, which the
$ manuals do not state.
$
$ Units: ft, lb, slug, s
$
SOL 144
TITLE = HA144A sbeam full-span, DMIJ/DMIK corrections
SUBCASE 1
  TRIM   = 1
  SPC    = 1
SUBCASE 2
  TRIM   = 2
  SPC    = 1
BEGIN BULK
$
